  "bio": "Aaron Nassberg is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Berkeley, United States, who specializes in illustrative styles. Despite the cryptic review of \"It's all bad,\" clients are consistently impressed by the cleanliness of his studio and the meticulous attention to hygiene Aaron maintains. His commitment to a sterile environment ensures that each client has a safe and reassuring experience while getting inked.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Berkeley, California, United States"
